{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_989687904#1_2148166421","relevance":3,"reason":"This passage is dedicated to the UK Clinical Practice Research Datalink study of BMI and diabetes diagnoses in children, explaining that type 2 diabetes is rising in parallel with obesity and describing the large England primary-care dataset used. It directly supports obesity as a major reason for rising young-onset type 2 diabetes in Britain.","learned":"Researchers used UK/England primary-care records for children aged 2–15 and found type 2 diabetes trends rising in parallel with obesity."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q513","reason":"The current query is producing highly relevant UK study evidence on obesity and young type 2 diabetes, so continue for additional direct supporting passages."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q513"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_42_608740313#4_1217381329","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q513","rank":4,"snippet":"Gestational diabetes Giving birth to a baby greater than 9 pounds Sedentary lifestyle Poor eating habits Smoking Dispelling stigma Tips to reduce risk The bottom line \" , \"segment\": \"It uses a formula to estimate your body fat based on your height and weight. The resulting BMI number indicates where you are on a scale of underweight to obese. A healthy BMI is between 18.5 and 24.9. Type 1 diabetes is commonly diagnosed in children. However, despite increasing rates of childhood obesity, research suggests weight is not a significant risk factor for this type of diabetes. One study found that the rising cases of type 2 diabetes were related to increases in childhood obesity, but not type 1. Abbasi A, et al. ( 2016). <cover>Body-mass index and incidence of type 1 and type 2 diabetes in children and young adults in the UK: </cover>an observational cohort study.\" , \"start_char\": 1814.000000 , \"title\": \"Can Skinny People Get Diabetes? Risk Factors, Prevention, and More\" , \"url\": \"https://www.healthline.com/health/diabetes/can-skinny-people-get-diabetes\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_989687904#0_2148163524","rank":3,"relevance":3}]}}
