{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"children and young adults\" \"type 2 diabetes\" \"uk\" (+ incidence rising obesity bmi))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_20_551413811#12_1216992294","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q523","rank":5,"snippet":"How does air pollution affect your health? What are the health effects of air pollution on adults? Cancer Asthma Stroke and heart failure Heart disease Diabetes Dementia Health effects of air pollution on <cover>children and young adults Asthma Lung development Brain development Obesity and diabetes What’s being done about air pollution in the UK? What can you do to protect yourself and your children from air pollution? Become a citizen scientist with Friends of the Earth's Clean Air Kit \" , \"segment\": \"This is according to research published by the British Medical Journal. Heart disease Air pollution is linked to the development of cardiovascular diseases, including furring of the arteries. It can also exacerbate conditions for those already living with heart disease. British Heart Foundation's Professor David Newby’s research suggests that people living with heart failure have an increased risk of being hospitalised and of dying where pollution levels are high. Diabetes The development of Type 2 diabetes </cover>is not only due to lifestyle or genetic factors, but also traffic-related air pollution, according to research by the American Diabetes Association. Dementia Links are being suggested between environmental factors and Alzheimer’s ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_989687904#3_2148170330","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_989687904#4_2148172439","rank":2,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_42_608740313#4_1217381329","rank":3,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_42_608740313#5_1217382663","rank":4,"relevance":2}]}}
